        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(RR)=\\frac{28}{90}$, $P(BB)=\\frac{15}{90}$; $P(\\text{same colour})=\\frac{43}{90}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(RR)&=\\frac{7}{10}\\times\\frac49\\\\P(RR)&=\\frac{28}{90}\\\\P(BB)&=\\frac{3}{10}\\times\\frac59\\\\P(BB)&=\\frac{15}{90}\\\\P(\\text{same colour})&=P(RR)+P(BB)\\\\P(\\text{same colour})&=\\frac{28}{90}+\\frac{15}{90}\\\\P(\\text{same colour})&=\\frac{43}{90}\\end{align*}$$",
